stablished.", "end_time_ms": 1790380799999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resumption: an H4 close above 2804.59 (bar 95 high) followed by a close above 2850 (bar 92 high) would re-establish a bull breakout-spike phase above the range.", "Range resolution lower: consecutive H4 closes below 2633.31 (bar 110 low) would take price out of the 27-bar range; a break below 2568.16 (bar 86 pullback low) would break the last bull higher low and shift the read toward a bear leg or a larger trading range.", "Breakout-mode resolution: a trend bar closing beyond either end of the bars 110-119 band (2633.31-2740.42) with the next bar continuing in the same direction would confirm a new leg.", "Continued mid-range closes inside 2633.31-2804.59 with heavy overlap would keep the range phase and balanced-pressure read intact."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2660.76", "close_time_ms": 1789959599999, "high": "2667.62", "low": "2647.48", "open": "2648.28", "open_time_ms": 1789956000000, "volume": "1909754.952"}, {"close": "2664.73", "close_time_ms": 1789963199999, "high": "2673.11", "low": "2657.53", "open": "2660.76", "open_time_ms": 1789959600000, "volume": "2059389.549"}, {"close": "2662.61", "close_time_ms": 1789966799999, "high": "2668.62", "low": "2652.74", "open": "2664.73", "open_time_ms": 1789963200000, "volume": "2027671.988"}, {"close": "2664.07", "close_time_ms": 1789970399999, "high": "2673.92", "low": "2658.08", "open": "2662.61", "open_time_ms": 1789966800000, "volume": "2018141.061"}, {"close": "2662.18", "close_time_ms": 1789973999999, "high": "2674.67", "low": "2658.08", "open": "2664.07", "open_time_ms": 1789970400000, "volume": "2058890.504"}, {"close": "2658.81", "close_time_ms": 1789977599999, "high": "2663.96", "low": "2646.02", "open": "2662.19", "open_time_ms": 178997400